            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/packages/sync",
            "description": "Register or update a package's tables and custom actions. Rebuilds the Cedar schema and evicts all PolicySet caches. Called by architect-sdk after a package install. Standard CRUD actions (getMaterials, postMaterials, etc.) are auto-generated from table names."
